This project ("the Software") is provided for **personal study, technical research
and private use only**. It **must not be used commercially** and **must not be
monetized in any way**.

### Permitted

- Personal download, installation and use for your own viewing and research
- Reading, studying and modifying the source code (modified versions remain
  subject to this license)
- Sharing a link to this project with attribution
- Opening issues and pull requests to help improve it

### Prohibited

- **Any commercial use**, including but not limited to selling the Software,
  bundling it into a paid product, embedding it in a commercial service, or
  using it in business operations
- **Any monetization**, including but not limited to paid distribution, advertising or
  traffic monetization (voluntary tips to the author are not in this category and
  grant no commercial rights)
- Any use that violates applicable laws or the terms of service of the
  underlying network-drive providers
- Removing or hiding this license and disclaimer

